0..81 Comment "// A product of two sums over free naturals has one normal form, however it sums."
82..84 Comment "//"
85..163 Comment "// Grégoire and Leroy normalise the product of 128 plus `x` and 128 plus `y`."
164..229 Comment "// Its free variables leave matches stuck inside the normal form."
230..232 Comment "//"
233..314 Comment "// Each factor runs sixteen successors past a free variable, so the product stops"
315..397 Comment "// on matches over `x` and `y`. The path writes both products, the right factor of"
398..425 Comment "// one summed in two steps."
426..428 Comment "//"
429..508 Comment "// - see: Grégoire and Leroy, _A compiled implementation of strong reduction_,"
509..529 Comment "//   ICFP 2002, § 6"
530..567 Comment "// - see: #2282 — the benchmark set"
569..609 Comment "// The free naturals and their addition."
610..616 Keyword "import"
617..618 StringLit "\""
618..641 StringLit "../data/data-base.gandr"
641..642 StringLit "\""
642..643 Other ";"
645..703 Comment "// The products and the numerals four, twelve and sixteen."
